      "message": "Not introduced here, but I think this method isn\u0027t useful anymore: `DeviceConfig.getInt(String, String, Int)` does basically the same thing. It was added at around the same time but reached AOSP later (ag/I10523a7b591d9f062d5de88c5fc4edd8c7c73ee0 vs. aosp/I8e1fb5b47fff3bf624131ba1f5732daabd991e6d)",
